  "name": "Swordsman",
  "type": "background",
  "img": "icons/weapons/swords/sword-guard.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>For years, you have studied the blade. Where most simply wield a sword in combat, you wield your blade as an artist, ready to make your mark on the world.</p>\n<p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> 2 from Athletics, Acrobatics, History, Perception</p>\n<p><strong>Weapon Proficiencies:</strong> 2 simple or martial melee weapons (piercing or slashing)</p>\n<p><strong>Equipment:</strong> 150,000 Berries; Small Medkits &times;3; Rations &times;5, a whetstone, a memento from a person from your past</p>\n<h4>Feature: Blade Mastery</h4>\n<p>As each swordsman is unique, so is their blade. You gain your choice of a weapon mastery feat with a simple or martial melee weapon that deals piercing or slashing damage.</p>",
